    "heading": "OLD THINGS HAVE PASSED AWAY (Eph 4:23):",
    "body": "Immediately you give your life to Christ, there must be an attitudinal change. Your behaviour must change from what it used to be, this must be physically evident because your old ways of life must irritate you. The old ways of life are the things that must pass away. Your encounter with Christ is to change your behaviour and not only about joining a new group called Christian",
    "sub_points": []
  },
  {
    "order": 2,
    "heading": "TRAITS OF A GENUINE CHRISTIAN:",
    "body": "He always show love (Eph 5:2) He always forgive He does not hurt people He is compassionate He is a light and he shines everywhere (Matt 5:14) He is tolerant and accommodating He works to feed and help other (Eph 4:28) His utterances are comforting and truth Eph (4:29) Fellowships with brethren in order to grow (Heb 10:24-25) He does not pretend (Eph 4:20-22)",
    "sub_points": []
  }
]

