[
  {
    "order": 1,
    "heading": "WHY SHOULD WE PRAY?",
    "body": "Prayer is a communication between man and God. Prayer helps to foster the relationship between man and God. What makes two friends to be close is communication. So prayer, which is communication between man and God, make our relationship with God to be deeper. Through prayer we make our intentions, request, feelings and others known to God. And in return, God speaks to us by revealing secret things to us. He may reveal His plan for our life, the plans of the enemy and other mysteries that we would not have known if we did not pray. We should not see prayer as a task, but as something we need to do with a friend which we cherish our relationship with.",
    "sub_points": []
  },
  {
    "order": 2,
    "heading": "OTHER SIGNIFICANCE OF PRAYER:",
    "body": "Prayer helps you get direction to your life. Prayer align your will to Godâs will Prayer works miracle Prayer gives you peace and confidence (1 Sam 30:8). Prayer is important to our spiritual growth Prayer makes us more compassionate person Prayer makes us stay hopeful in dark times Prayer makes us connect to God on a deeper level",
    "sub_points": []
  }
]

[
